title: init generates two different aliases for one session (MCP auto-register vs register step)
---
After init, .mcp.json env has C2C_MCP_AUTO_REGISTER_ALIAS=one alias, but init's register step picked a different one (what whoami reports). Once the MCP server loads it will auto-register the other alias, so live identity won't match what init reported. Single consistent alias needed. Repro: c2c init --client claude (without --alias); compare .mcp.json env vs c2c whoami